---
description: Enforce production security and reliability standards on Docker, Helm, and Terraform files
globs: ["**/Dockerfile", "**/*.tf", "charts/**/*.yaml"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Container images must use explicit version tags or SHA digests—never `:latest`.
- Kubernetes workloads must define `resources.requests`, `resources.limits`, `livenessProbe`, and `readinessProbe`.
- AWS Security Groups must never allow `0.0.0.0/0` ingress on administrative ports (22, 3389).